### BCP PDF Extractor - REST Client Tests
### Variables
@baseUrl = http://127.0.0.1:8001

### 1. Health Check - Get API Info
GET {{baseUrl}}/
Accept: application/json

###

### 2. Process PDF by Name - EECC102025_06878124.PDF (Downloads CSV directly)
POST {{baseUrl}}/process-pdf
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "pdf_filename": "files/EECC102025_06878124.PDF",
    "type": "credit"
}

###

### 3. Process PDF by Name - EECC102025_06878124.PDF (Returns JSON info)
POST {{baseUrl}}/process-pdf/info
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "pdf_filename": "files/EECC102025_06878124.PDF"
}

###

### 4. Process PDF by Name - EECC102025_09745280.PDF (Downloads CSV directly)
POST {{baseUrl}}/process-pdf
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "pdf_filename": "files/EECC102025_09745280.PDF",
    "type": "debit"
}

###

### 5. Process PDF by Name - EECC102025_09745280.PDF (Returns JSON info)  
POST {{baseUrl}}/process-pdf/info
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "pdf_filename": "files/EECC102025_09745280.PDF"
}

###

### 6. List Output Files
GET {{baseUrl}}/output
Accept: application/json

###

### 7. Download CSV Output - EECC102025_06878124
GET {{baseUrl}}/output/EECC102025_06878124_transactions.csv

###

### 8. Download CSV Output - EECC102025_09745280
GET {{baseUrl}}/output/EECC102025_09745280_transactions.csv

###

### 9. Test Credit Card PDF (Should return 501 Not Implemented)
POST {{baseUrl}}/process-pdf
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "pdf_filename": "files/EECC102025_06878124.PDF",
    "type": "credit"
}

###

### 10. Test Invalid Type (Should return 400 Bad Request)
POST {{baseUrl}}/process-pdf
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "pdf_filename": "files/EECC102025_06878124.PDF",
    "type": "invalid_type"
}

###

### 9. Extract PDF (Upload) - For comparison
# POST {{baseUrl}}/extract-pdf
# Content-Type: multipart/form-data; boundary=----WebKitFormBoundary7MA4YWxkTrZu0gW
# 
# ------WebKitFormBoundary7MA4YWxkTrZu0gW
# Content-Disposition: form-data; name="file"; filename="EECC102025_06878124.PDF"
# Content-Type: application/pdf
# 
# < ./files/EECC102025_06878124.PDF
# ------WebKitFormBoundary7MA4YWxkTrZu0gW--

###

### 10. Extract PDF to Excel (Upload) - For comparison  
# POST {{baseUrl}}/extract-pdf/excel
